[A10] Add to this lane's scope (#397 composition review R348-3 S1, issuecomment-5857601913). When this lane re-runs the #397 service-budget harness after the firmware change, refresh `docs/findings/397_SERVICE_BUDGET.md` so it states:
- the tree it measured;
- that the earlier 8x8 figures came from `ac18b509`, where the 8x8's generated gPTP and lwSRP constants still followed the then-100 MHz declaration;
- the new figures at the merged 50 MHz 8x8 declaration.
